  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722690,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, this can take\na minute or two,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724430,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we'll look at one I\ngenerated ahead of time."
