  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5137930,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll hit Create."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5139850,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just like that,\nour multi-agent system"
